  PHASE 0: Foundation Cleanup (1 week)

  0.1 Terminology Standardization

  Current (Confusing)          →  v0.1 (Clear)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
  grid-search                  →  tune (hyperparameter tuning)
  walk-forward                 →  validate (cross-validation)
  walk-forward-ml              →  train (model training)
  backtest                     →  evaluate (single evaluation)
  simulate-campaign            →  simulate (campaign simulation)

  0.2 Architecture Refactor

  Current:
    algorithms/
      ├── traits.rs           (MarketMakingAlgorithm trait)
      ├── avellaneda_stoikov.rs
      └── ml_spread_skew.rs

